            "id": "4946107",
            "title": "Wall Street Lunch: Tesla's Roadster Could Be Ready To Take Flight",
            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Tesla Cybertruck display at a dealership. Tesla offers the Cybertruck with driving range of up to 334 miles. MY:2025\" data-id=\"2241187572\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2241187572/image_2241187572.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2241187572/image_2241187572.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2241187572/image_2241187572.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2241187572/image_2241187572.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2241187572/image_2241187572.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2241187572/image_2241187572.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2241187572/image_2241187572.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2241187572/image_2241187572.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2241187572/image_2241187572.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p> <p>Listen below or on the go on <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/wall-street-breakfast/id1358381502\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Apple Podcasts</a> and <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/05uLjJxkVgQsRk8LWLCLpx?si=r3_yJgxiQiivJwNQG8WNew&amp;nd=1\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Spotify</a></p> <p></p><div class=\"pcast hidden-print\">\n<div class=\"pcast__section-1\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"pcast__top-img pcast__marketing\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/uploads/2018/11/21/podcast_series_header.png?io=w640\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pcast__section-2\"><iframe frameborder=\"0\" height=\"200px\" sap-id=\"4\" src=\"https://widget.spreaker.com/player?episode_id=75121321&amp;theme=light&amp;playlist=false&amp;playlist-continuous=false&amp;chapters-image=true&amp;episode_image_position=right&amp;hide-logo=true&amp;hide-likes=true&amp;hide-comments=true&amp;hide-sharing=true&amp;hide-download=true&amp;color=ff6900\" title=\"Tesla Roadster could finally take flight\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></div>\n<div class=\"pcast__section-3\">\n<div class=\"pcast__ad-container\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Tesla's long-awaited Roadster <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642311-tesla-plans-for-a-next-gen-roadster-reveal-on-october-1\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">may finally show off its hover trick</a>. (0:14) Corning tumbles after <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642404-corning-slides-as-investors-digest-2b-equity-distribution-agreement\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">announcing share sale</a>. (1:17) Anthropic <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642518-anthropic-still-likely-to-go-public-this-year-despite-ai-uproar-report\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">IPO still on</a> for this year? (2:06) </p> <p>This is an abridged transcript of the podcast:</p> <p>Our top story so far, at least we may get flying cars before AI kills us all.</p> <p>Tesla (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/TSLA\" title=\"Tesla, Inc.\">TSLA</a></span>) has <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642311-tesla-plans-for-a-next-gen-roadster-reveal-on-october-1\">an Oct. 1 event scheduled that is expected to be a public unveiling or major update for the long-delayed second-generation Roadster model.</a></p> <p>The event is expected to take place at SpaceX's (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SPCX\" title=\"Space Exploration Technologies Corp.\">SPCX</a></span>) test facility in McGregor, Texas. The EV maker has not released the final price, production timetable or customer-delivery dates for the long-awaited Roadster.</p> <p>According to reports, the event’s most anticipated feature is a possible demonstration of a Roadster using SpaceX-derived cold-gas thrusters. Tesla's \"Go for launch\" teaser and years of Elon Musk’s statements have fueled expectations that the car could briefly lift or hover.</p> <p>Cold-gas thrusters would use pressurized gas to create short bursts of force rather than conventional combustion rockets.</p> <p>Among active stocks, Netflix (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NFLX\" title=\"Netflix, Inc.\">NFLX</a>) <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642474-netflix-price-target-raised-to-110-by-evercore-on-survey-gains-live-event-opportunity\">is higher after Evercore ISI raised its price target on the streaming platform to $110 from $100 while reiterating its Outperform rating.</a></p> <p>Evercore cited improving trends in its U.S. and Japan surveys and opportunities from live events and short-form content.</p> <p>Corning (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/GLW\" title=\"Corning Incorporated\">GLW</a>) <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642404-corning-slides-as-investors-digest-2b-equity-distribution-agreement\">is tumbling after announcing it entered into an equity distribution agreement with Goldman Sachs to sell up to $2B in shares in an “at the market” equity offering.</a></p> <p>And <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642530-hedgeye-says-go-long-sea-limited-short-mercadolibre-in-pair-trade\">Hedgeye recommends going long Sea Limited (SE) and short MercadoLibre (MELI) in a pair trade.</a></p> <p>\"We believe TikTok Shop is increasingly shifting investment toward Brazil, where MELI investors may be underestimating the competitive threat,” analyst Felix Wang said. “For SE, a more selective TikTok strategy in Southeast Asia could actually relieve pressure and support Shopee margin upside.\"</p> <p>In other news of note, Anthropic (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ANTHRO\" title=\"Anthropic\">ANTHRO</a>) <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642518-anthropic-still-likely-to-go-public-this-year-despite-ai-uproar-report\">is still likely to go public this year</a>, despite CEO Dario Amodei's recent warning that the broader artificial intelligence sector needs to slow down, Axios reported.</p> <p>Recent media reports suggest that the AI frontier lab has picked the Nasdaq as the exchange that will list its shares, with an IPO coming as soon as next month.</p> <p>Anthropic has also reportedly tapped Morgan Stanley (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MS\" title=\"Morgan Stanley\">MS</a>) and Goldman Sachs (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/GS\" title=\"The Goldman Sachs Group, Inc.\">GS</a>) to help lead the offering, which could see it raise as much as $100B.</p> <p>And in the Wall Street Research Corner, the Goldman Sachs equity team has rebalanced its Long Duration Basket amid rising interest rates.</p> <p>Equities usually struggle to digest sharp increases in interest rates, with long duration growth stocks struggling disproportionately from rising discount rates.</p> <p>Among the names are Coca-Cola (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/KO\" title=\"The Coca-Cola Company\">KO</a>), DraftKings (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DKNG\" title=\"DraftKings Inc.\">DKNG</a>), EchoStar (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ECHO\" title=\"EchoStar Corporation\">ECHO</a>), Moderna (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MRNA\" title=\"Moderna, Inc.\">MRNA</a>) and Snowflake (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SNOW\" title=\"Snowflake Inc.\">SNOW</a>).</p> <p>See the full basket on <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642291-goldman-rebalances-its-long-duration-stock-basket\">Seeking Alpha</a>.</p></body></html>",
